{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Gather. Explore. Alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a small island \u2014 no people, no noise, just the wind and the sea. From nothing but scattered wreckage and raw materials, you\u2019ll build your own world one piece at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Far From All</strong> is a peaceful yet purposeful survival-builder about isolation, creation, and the quiet satisfaction of turning wilderness into a working island. Chop trees, gather resources, and place machines to automate your survival. Watch your island slowly come alive as you shape it to your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>Build your island</strong> \u2013 place, craft, and automate with simple, satisfying controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic world</strong> \u2013 day and night, weather, and changing light bring the island to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Relaxed survival</strong> \u2013 no combat or pressure, just you, your tools, and the world you build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Hand-crafted pixel world</strong> \u2013 colorful, top-down visuals with a soft retro feel.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush here \u2014 only progress at your own pace.<br><strong>Far From All</strong> is about finding rhythm in solitude.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101000?t=1762236732","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101000?t=1762236732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101000/80d75ca2f714e496b36e4e6b070253fae2d0f9e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762236732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101000/80d75ca2f714e496b36e4e6b070253fae2d0f9e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762236732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Gather. Explore. Alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a small island \u2014 no people, no noise, just the wind and the sea. From nothing but scattered wreckage and raw materials, you\u2019ll build your own world one piece at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Far From All</strong> is a peaceful yet purposeful survival-builder about isolation, creation, and the quiet satisfaction of turning wilderness into a working island. Chop trees, gather resources, and place machines to automate your survival. Watch your island slowly come alive as you shape it to your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>Build your island</strong> \u2013 place, craft, and automate with simple, satisfying controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic world</strong> \u2013 day and night, weather, and changing light bring the island to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Relaxed survival</strong> \u2013 no combat or pressure, just you, your tools, and the world you build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Hand-crafted pixel world</strong> \u2013 colorful, top-down visuals with a soft retro feel.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush here \u2014 only progress at your own pace.<br><strong>Far From All</strong> is about finding rhythm in solitude.</p>","developers":["avowrot"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.